&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Smartly is looking for a Senior Director, Organizational Transformation &amp;amp; Workforce Design to help shape how our organization evolves as we scale globally and embed AI more deeply into how we work. Reporting to the Chief People Officer and working within the CHRO Office, you will partner with leaders across Smartly to translate business strategy into organizational structures, workforce models, leadership capabilities, and transformation programs that help our teams operate effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead enterprise transformation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; across organizational design, leadership effectiveness, workforce evolution, new site and hub integration, and cross-functional operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design how work evolves in an AI-enabled organization&lt;/strong&gt;, partnering with leaders to rethink roles, workflows, team structures, and operating models as AI creates new opportunities to increase effectiveness and leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable workforce frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;, including job architecture, career frameworks, and approaches that help Smartly make thoughtful decisions about how teams and capabilities should evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen leadership and manager capability&lt;/strong&gt; by partnering with HR Business Partners and senior leaders to design leadership frameworks, manager development programs, and other scalable capability-building initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate business priorities into transformation roadmaps&lt;/strong&gt;, defining clear implementation plans, governance, measures of success, and approaches for driving sustainable adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advise senior leaders on complex organizational challenges&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing structured thinking and organizational expertise to decisions about structure, capabilities, ways of working, and change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align stakeholders across functions and geographies&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring organizational changes are practical, clearly understood, and connected to measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience leading organizational transformation, organizational design, workforce design, strategy, or related work, either within organizations or in management consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of organizational design and operating models, with experience translating business strategy into practical organizational solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-functional transformation initiatives and moving from strategy and design through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing leadership, manager, or organizational capability programs that can scale across an organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to advise and influence executive stakeholders, navigate different perspectives, and build alignment around complex decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong structured problem-solving skills and the ability to turn ambiguous organizational challenges into clear frameworks and actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with change management and stakeholder engagement across teams, functions, and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about AI-enabled organizations and a practical perspective on how AI can reshape roles, workflows, team structures, and the future of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Smartly, we offer a place where you can advance your career. Here, you&#39;ll find:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Inclusive Global Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team of over 750 Smartlies, representing more than 60 nationalities across 24 locations in 13 countries. We cultivate a culture built on trust, transparency, and open feedback, where diverse perspectives are valued and encouraged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to a company making a global impact, directly influencing our customers&#39; success and business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus on Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; We prioritize your health with healthcare packages, mental health services, and a commitment to work-life balance through paid holidays and family leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt; Benefit from equity options, performance-based rewards, competitive compensation, and career development opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Hybrid Workplace:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience a hybrid work model, balancing office collaboration with remote work, and the option to work abroad for up to 30 days annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Apply Now and Build Your Future with Smartly!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Curious what it’s like to work at Smartly? Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.smartly.io/careers&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt; to see how we grow, collaborate, and make impact together&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Smartly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is the AI-powered advertising technology company transforming ad experiences for brands and their consumers. Our comprehensive advertising platform seamlessly integrates the capabilities of media, creative, and intelligence to power more than 800 billion impressions and generate more than 300 billion creatives annually, delivering tangible business outcomes for brands and advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Smartly is the only company in the industry recognized as a Leader in The Forrester Wave: Creative Advertising Technologies with PwC validating the results it delivers for brands. We manage creative and media for 700+ brands worldwide and $6B in ad spend across the largest media platforms, including Facebook, Google, Instagram, Pinterest, Snap, and TikTok. Our end-to-end technology, unmatched access to media platforms and exceptional customer service help Fortune 500 brands to reach and engage consumers and learn what performs best.Smartly is a multinational and diverse team of 750+ Smartlies from 60+ nationalities, working in 13 countries. Together, we want to create and maintain an inclusive environment where everyone feels respected and heard. Our Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion approach is at the heart of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://smartly.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://Smartly.io&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Smartly&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The processing of your information is described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67ed4ab7f914accf87aa070c/698a11cb716926c1d76c1641_Smartly.io%20Group%20-%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Candidates%20-%201_2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;With millions of diners, 70,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Director of Engineering to lead the Global Partnerships engineering organization across Solutions Engineering, Integrations, and API Platform. This leader will combine product engineering judgment, technical depth, customer empathy, and operating discipline to make our partnership ecosystem easier to build on and easier to scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will lead the Solutions Engineering and the engineering teams responsible for partner integrations and API platform capabilities. You will work closely with Product, Partnerships, RSS, Support, Security, Legal, and other engineering leaders to turn partner and business needs into durable platform capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for a leader who can move comfortably between strategy and execution: setting direction, simplifying an operating model, making hard prioritization calls, guiding architecture, handling high-severity escalations, and developing managers and senior technical leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.3;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
